  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Minor in Tourism"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Minors",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Minors",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/minors/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The Tourism Minor is intended to provide a complementary area of study for students who wish to understand the nature, content, and structure of tourism experiences and operations. Whether it is from a personal perspective fostering critical reflection of our own motivations and behaviours, or disciplinary lenses that consider a range of outcomes of tourism activity (e.g., economic, social, environmental), tourism is a context ripe for examination."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "The operating sectors of tourism are typically listed as attractions, events, travel trade (e.g., tour operators), accommodation, transportation, adventure recreation, entertainment, food services, and tourism services (e.g., planning)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Administered by: Ted Rogers School of Hospitality and Tourism Management"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Exclusions: This minor is not available to students in the following programs:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "Hospitality and Tourism Management , all options",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "Hospitality and Tourism Management",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/programs/trsm/hospitality/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "To receive this Minor, students must complete six (6) courses from the following curriculum:"
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Required course (1):"
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "text": "HTT 100 Tourism Experiences Management or HTT 150 Tourism Demand, Supply and Distribution",
      "links": [
        {
          "text": "HTT 100",
          "url": "https://www.torontomu.ca/calendar/2026-2027/courses/hospitality-and-tourism-management/HTT/100/"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "text",
      "text": "Plus five (5) from the following:"
    },
